{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──瀨名同學總是迅速又俐落地完成班級幹部的工作。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君，過來一下。」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0282", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯。怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「班級幹部的工作。要跟料理實習的老師報告分組的事。」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0283", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天也像這樣，帶著我去做許多幹部的工作。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君！要去職員室了。下次上課的資料，各務台的同學的份不夠。」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0284", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，瞭解。」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那邊結束後，順便找八塚老師拿我們班考試範圍要點的影印喔。」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0285", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「知道了，那邊的我來搬吧……」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她不停喊我一起做事，非常積極而且迅速確實地完成一件又一件的工作。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──為什麼她會如此主動積極呢？", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然不懂，但我身為她的搭檔也只能跟上去了。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要拖拖拉拉的！」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0286", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「立刻就去、立刻就去……」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也只能跟上去了……", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎、怎麼樣？好吃嗎，瓜生君？」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "jc0023", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……嗯，好好吃！嗯，這個好好吃……」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀嗯～太好了安潔！」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "jc0024", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太好了呢。安潔的幫忙也有了回報♪」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0209", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然特別課程有很多不同的內容，不過大概是因為最初的關係，我覺得還是料理實習最輕鬆。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且班上的同學們也變得會拿成品來讓我試味道。", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思在你們開心的時候打擾，瓜生君，過來。」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0287", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，愛理同學。」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0210", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「理科的老師好像身體不舒服，要去確認下一節課要不要換教室。」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0288", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、啊，知道了。抱歉喔，待會再來試味道吧……」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……被帶走了。」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0211", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔！瀨名同學好狡猾～」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "jc0025", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一旦習慣了這種豪華，在學生食堂吃午飯也挺不錯的。", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君的便當總是很漂亮呢～」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "mu0115", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕！」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "pn0053", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是櫻乃花功夫幫我做的喔，對吧，櫻乃？」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想既然要就讀結女，就不能帶隨便的東西來。」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0262", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好用心喔……這種想法很重要呢。我也是要跟美羽學姊見面時就特別起勁。」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0058", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一直以來謝謝妳，櫻乃。多虧了妳我從來不覺得比不上別人。」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是也因此增加了不少伙食費吧。啊哈哈哈，真是難解啊～」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 496, "voice": "ht0142", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學生食堂的桌子很大，很適合多人一起吃飯聊天。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近一起吃午飯的人越來越多了。今天有天羽學姊、熊喵和乾同學。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君。」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0289", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？啊、我在。」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟我來一下。剛才八塚老師說了些事……」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0290", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我去一下，大家慢慢吃喔。」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗚嚕。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "pn0054", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君被帶走了。」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "mu0116", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君是愛理的奴隸嗎？」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0059", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理只喜歡找哥哥……」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0263", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那種喜歡我可不要～」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 496, "voice": "ht0143", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……總之，剩下的就等放學後。盡快著手盡快結束。」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0291", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼？」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0292", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有，瞭解了。」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──雖然我拼命地跟上她。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本瀨名同學的感應天線就很敏銳，再加上最近我身處人群中的機會也增加了很多。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以「跟大家在一起時被瀨名同學帶走」的情況就經常發生。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為我是會在意周圍反應的類型，突然離席讓我對其他人感到抱歉。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而更讓我在意的是……在大家的眼中看來，瀨名同學動不動就把我帶走的行為……", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那走吧。」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0293", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好好。」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這女孩沒有意識到吧。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0294", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放學後，瀨名同學依然沙沙沙地快速滑動筆尖。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打擾了～愛理同學、新吾同學，不嫌棄的話安潔去泡杯茶吧？」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0212", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝，但是我現在不想喝。」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0295", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她回答安潔的時候連頭也沒抬。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "該做的工作就專心一志認真地處理，全神貫注的姿態。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學都這樣了，我也不能鬆懈。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "既然決定要跟上她了，就要盡全力跟上才行。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也不用了。抱歉喔安潔，謝謝妳特地要幫忙泡茶。」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會不會。反倒是如果安潔也是班級幹部的話就可以幫忙了，不好意思喔。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0213", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果有什麼需要，請隨時吩咐安潔。」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0214", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係，就快要結束了……」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0296", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，結束。」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0297", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔喔，辛苦了！」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0215", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好，我也結束了。」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸！？」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0298", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "多虧了我拼命努力的成果，第一次跟她同時結束了工作。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抬起頭跟她對上了視線。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0299", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學維持著要站不站的姿勢，尷尬地轉開臉。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎麼看，都感覺是來不及說出「先回去了」的狀態。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……同時完成工作不好嗎？", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼，讓安潔泡杯茶來好嗎～？」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0216", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不用──」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，愛理。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0264", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正要阻止安潔的時候，櫻乃推開門走了進來。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為中午好像就做了很多工作，所以想說今天或許可以一起回家。」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0265", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這個……該說時機很好還是很差呢……", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃走向瀨名同學。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「結束了？」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0266", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……剛、剛結束。」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0300", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學越來越尷尬了。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理！太榮幸了，美羽學姊來約我們了喔！」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0060", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君、小愛理～工作結束的話就一起回去吧……咦？」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "mu0117", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "天羽學姊和乾同學也走了進來。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像時機剛剛好呢。一起回家吧？瓜生君、小愛理。」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "mu0118", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，好的，我是沒問題啦……」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瞄了一眼瀨名同學。", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很感謝大家的邀請。但我還是很在意……", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學，妳有什麼其他緊急的事要做嗎……？」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……今天不行嗎？愛理。」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0267", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0301", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃歪著頭，詢問瀨名同學。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管是天羽學姊還是櫻乃，這種才藝我是辦不到的，真厲害……", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是瀨名同學她……", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……今天可以。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0302", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦！？是、是嗎？」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，今天的話……」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0303", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她平常總是很快就回去，今天工作又做得特別快，我還以為她放學後還很忙呢……", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來也不是經常都這樣。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;「反倒是明天……」", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "「反倒是明天……」", "plain_idx": 356, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0304", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒什麼。那今天就跟大家一起放學吧。」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0305", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔。」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0268", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼，為彌補沒有泡茶的遺憾，就讓安潔送大家出門吧！」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0217", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0306", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她看起來超不情願的，真的可以嗎？", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請慢走、請慢走～♪」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "ag0218", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家明天見囉！」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "mu0119", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，今天要去美羽學姊家玩，很羨慕對吧？但是只有我去喔～」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0061", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明來約一起放學，但是卻很快就脫隊了……算了，說這些也沒用……」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0307", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一起走出校門後，因為家的位置不同，人數一下子就減少了。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉讓妳陪我們了，瀨名同學。」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這不是瓜生君要道歉的事。約的人是學姊和櫻乃。」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0308", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就用聊天來彌補吧。」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0269", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或許是被使命感驅使？櫻乃點了點頭，走到瀨名同學身旁。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過再走一段路就要跟瀨名同學道別了。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理平常都去哪裡買東西呢？」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0270", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？呃……隨便去。」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0309", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0271", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我都去家附近的超市。還有那間久米超市，明天是特賣日。」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0272", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔……！！」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0310", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學突然被絆到了腳。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0273", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒什麼！」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0311", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看起來不像沒什麼的樣子啊……", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過此時當然不能吐槽逼問她。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉抱歉，失禮了。櫻乃繼續說吧。」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……從蔬菜到日用品，都便宜得不得了。愛理覺得可以的話，我也推薦妳去。」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0274", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，仔細想想像瀨名同學這種大小姐，不會去我們這種平民逛的超市吧？」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼說也對。而且這裡也有各務台商場呢，愛理。」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0275", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就、就是說啊……」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0312", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們第一次相遇，就是我去各務台商場的時候呢。」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0276", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0313", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那……今天辛苦了。」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0314", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在分開的路口，往回家方向去的瀨名同學……走得比平常還急，甚至像用跑的一樣。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……愛理果然在趕什麼事情吧。」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0277", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有點對不起她。」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0278", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～這個嘛……」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我覺得如果真的沒辦法她也不會硬是陪我們，所以不用在意沒關係喔，櫻乃。」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我就放心了。」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0279", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格是讓我放心的高手呢。」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "sk0280", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過對瀨名同學卻沒有用呢……這句話我沒有說出口。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
